<title>USA: ABC Dispensing in compliance with Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>ABC Dispensing in compliance with Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABC Dispensing Technologies Inc said Friday it was back in full compliance with all requirements for its stock to continue to be listed on the NASDAQ SmallCap Market.</p>
<p>In a press release, the company said its financial condition had improved as a result of new equity being invested in the company.</p>
